<!-- 第九轮 m1 第 8 项:首次进漫游的大气层转场。真实地图已经在下面铺好,视频盖在上面,播完淡出露出地图。
     点任意处跳过;网络慢 / 减弱动态 / 加载失败或超时都直接不出现。 -->
<view wx:if="{{phase !== 'off'}}" class="atm atm-scrim {{phase === 'fade' ? 'is-fade' : ''}} {{phase === 'play' ? 'is-on' : ''}}"
      bindtap="skip" aria-role="button" aria-label="跳过转场" hover-class="none">
  <video id="atmVideo" class="atm__video" src="{{src}}" autoplay muted="{{true}}" loop="{{false}}"
         controls="{{false}}" show-center-play-btn="{{false}}" show-fullscreen-btn="{{false}}" show-play-btn="{{false}}"
         show-progress="{{false}}" enable-progress-gesture="{{false}}" object-fit="cover"
         bindplay="onPlay" bindended="onEnded" binderror="onError"></video>
</view>
